LINDOS-PLACEHOLDER-KEYRING
This file is NOT a keyring. It stands in for the Lindos archive public key until the owner
creates the signing key (docs/RELEASING.md) and commits the real binary keyring here
(gpg --export, no --armor). A package build never ships this file: build/mkdeb.sh drops it and
refuses to build a switched-on source while it is still here.
